msgstr "Activer ou non les messages à l'écran."

msgctxt "game_options"
msgid ""
"Enables run-ahead. Doubles CPU requirements. High numbers can result in "
"visible jitter."
msgstr ""
"Activer le calcul d'images en avance, des grandes valeurs provoquent des "
"sauts d'images."

msgctxt "game_options"
msgid ""
"Enables surround sound if your audio card supports it (Consumes more "
"bandwidth)."
msgstr ""
"Activer le son surround si la carte audio le supporte (consomme plus de "
"bande passante)."

msgctxt "game_options"
msgid ""
"Enabling will allow for correct emulation of texture wrapping. This comes at "
"a cost of potential worse performance."
msgstr ""
"Cette option permet une émulation correcte de l'enroulage des textures. Cela "
"a un impact sur les performances."

msgctxt "game_options"
msgid "Enabling will smooth out the image."
msgstr "Activer pour lisser l'image."

